			text = "Imithethonkambiso okukhululnywa ngayo kulesi sigaba ingamisa amacala kanye nokuhlawulisa inhlawulo, noma ukugcinwa ejele isikhathi esingeke saba ngaphezulu kwezinyanga eziyisithupha, noma kokubili inhlawulo nokugcinwa ejele."
